flowchart LR
  accTitle: Security privacy and access control pattern
  accDescr: Classified data and approved purposes feed policy decisions that allow masked governed products or deny raw sensitive access while recording evidence.
  A[Classified sensitive data] --> C[Policy decision]
  B[Identity role and approved purpose] --> C
  C -->|allow| D[Masked governed product]
  C -->|deny| E[Blocked raw access]
  D --> F[Approved consumer]
  C --> G[Decision evidence]
  D --> H[Access evidence]
  E --> H
